# Casos de uso, puertos y adaptadores

## Caso de uso principal: `AssignCourierUseCase`

### Intención

Asignar un repartidor disponible a una entrega preparada, respetando las
invariantes del negocio y publicando el resultado para que otros módulos
reaccionen.

### Contrato de aplicación

> ```csharp
> public sealed record AssignCourierCommand(
>     Guid DeliveryId,
>     Guid CourierId,
>     string RequestedBy);
>
> public sealed record AssignCourierResult(
>     Guid DeliveryId,
>     Guid CourierId,
>     DateTime AssignedAt);
> ```

### Flujo del caso de uso

> ```mermaid
> sequenceDiagram
>     participant Ctrl as DeliveryController
>     participant UC as AssignCourierUseCase
>     participant Repo as IDeliveryRepository
>     participant Stock as IStockReservationPort
>     participant Avail as ICourierAvailabilityPort
>     participant Cap as IRouteCapacityPort
>     participant Dom as Delivery
>     participant Pub as IEventPublisher
>
>     Ctrl->>UC: ExecuteAsync(cmd)
>     UC->>Repo: GetAsync(deliveryId)
>     Repo-->>UC: Delivery
>     UC->>Stock: IsReservedAsync(orderId)
>     Stock-->>UC: true
>     UC->>Avail: IsAvailableAsync(courierId)
>     Avail-->>UC: true
>     UC->>Cap: HasCapacityAsync(courierId)
>     Cap-->>UC: true
>     UC->>Dom: AssignCourier(courierId, requestedBy)
>     Dom-->>UC: ok (estado Asignada)
>     UC->>Repo: SaveAsync(delivery)
>     UC->>Pub: PublishAsync(DeliveryAssigned)
>     UC-->>Ctrl: AssignCourierResult
> ```

### Implementación (aplicación)

> ```csharp
> public sealed class AssignCourierUseCase
> {
>     private readonly IDeliveryRepository _deliveryRepo;
>     private readonly ICourierAvailabilityPort _courierPort;
>     private readonly IRouteCapacityPort _routePort;
>     private readonly IStockReservationPort _stockPort;
>     private readonly IEventPublisher _events;
>
>     public AssignCourierUseCase(
>         IDeliveryRepository deliveryRepo,
>         ICourierAvailabilityPort courierPort,
>         IRouteCapacityPort routePort,
>         IStockReservationPort stockPort,
>         IEventPublisher events)
>     {
>         _deliveryRepo = deliveryRepo;
>         _courierPort = courierPort;
>         _routePort = routePort;
>         _stockPort = stockPort;
>         _events = events;
>     }
>
>     public async Task<AssignCourierResult> ExecuteAsync(
>         AssignCourierCommand cmd, CancellationToken ct)
>     {
>         var delivery = await _deliveryRepo.GetAsync(
>             new DeliveryId(cmd.DeliveryId), ct)
>             ?? throw new DomainException("Delivery not found");
>
>         // INV-02: stock reservado
>         if (!await _stockPort.IsReservedAsync(delivery.OrderId, ct))
>             throw new DomainException("Stock not reserved");
>
>         // INV-04: disponibilidad
>         if (!await _courierPort.IsAvailableAsync(
>                 new CourierId(cmd.CourierId), ct))
>             throw new DomainException("Courier not available");
>
>         // INV-03: capacidad de ruta
>         if (!await _routePort.HasCapacityAsync(
>                 new CourierId(cmd.CourierId), ct))
>             throw new DomainException("Route capacity exceeded");
>
>         // INV-01 e INV-06: la entidad protege las invariantes
>         delivery.AssignCourier(new CourierId(cmd.CourierId), cmd.RequestedBy);
>
>         await _deliveryRepo.SaveAsync(delivery, ct);
>
>         await _events.PublishAsync(
>             new DeliveryAssigned(
>                 delivery.Id.Value,
>                 cmd.CourierId,
>                 DateTime.UtcNow),
>             ct);
>
>         return new AssignCourierResult(
>             delivery.Id.Value,
>             cmd.CourierId,
>             DateTime.UtcNow);
>     }
> }
> ```

## Puertos (interfaces definidas por Aplicación)

| Puerto | Dirección | Propósito | Adaptador futuro (Actividad 4) |
|---|---|---|---|
| `IDeliveryRepository` | Salida | Persistir y recuperar entregas | EF Core / PostgreSQL |
| `ICourierAvailabilityPort` | Salida | Consultar disponibilidad del repartidor | Servicio de repartidores / BD |
| `IRouteCapacityPort` | Salida | Verificar capacidad de ruta | Servicio de rutas / BD |
| `IStockReservationPort` | Salida | Verificar reserva de stock | Módulo Inventario (interno) |
| `IEventPublisher` | Salida | Publicar eventos de dominio | Bus interno / cola |
| `AssignCourierUseCase` | Entrada | Orquestar la asignación | Controlador REST / consumidor de eventos |

### Contratos de los puertos

> ```csharp
> public interface IDeliveryRepository
> {
>     Task<Delivery?> GetAsync(DeliveryId id, CancellationToken ct);
>     Task SaveAsync(Delivery delivery, CancellationToken ct);
> }
>
> public interface ICourierAvailabilityPort
> {
>     Task<bool> IsAvailableAsync(CourierId id, CancellationToken ct);
> }
>
> public interface IRouteCapacityPort
> {
>     Task<bool> HasCapacityAsync(CourierId id, CancellationToken ct);
> }
>
> public interface IStockReservationPort
> {
>     Task<bool> IsReservedAsync(OrderId orderId, CancellationToken ct);
> }
>
> public interface IEventPublisher
> {
>     Task PublishAsync<TEvent>(TEvent @event, CancellationToken ct)
>         where TEvent : class;
> }
> ```

## Adaptadores (infraestructura, se implementan en Actividad 4)

| Adaptador | Implementa | Tecnología prevista |
|---|---|---|
| `EfDeliveryRepository` | `IDeliveryRepository` | EF Core + PostgreSQL |
| `HttpCourierAdapter` | `ICourierAvailabilityPort` | HTTP + REST |
| `HttpRouteAdapter` | `IRouteCapacityPort` | HTTP + REST |
| `InventoryHttpAdapter` | `IStockReservationPort` | HTTP interno entre módulos |
| `RabbitEventPublisher` | `IEventPublisher` | RabbitMQ / bus interno |

